  "body": "#1229 introduced `COEP: credentialless`. The later cookie integration in #1807 appears to have inverted the original intent:\n\n```diff\nTo check if Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy allows credentials...\n\n-4. If request's origin is same origin with request's current URL's origin and request's tainted origin flag is not set, then return true.\n+5. If request's origin is same origin with request's current URL's origin and request's redirect-taint is not \"same-origin\", then return true.\n```\n\nI think \"not\" should be removed.",
